  "title": "Unified title",
  "summary": "PHASE is a physiology-guided foundation model that explicitly learns and encodes physiological characteristics from intracranial EEG data, while Cyclostationary Phase Conditioning improves signal restoration from corrupted physiological time series. These studies highlight advancements in EEG decoding and subject-awareness.",
